# Notes.md Source Summary

This source introduces "Notes" as a mental model — a conceptual tool for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. It is referenced as a cross-source perspective tied to Sönke Ahrens' How to Take Smart Notes. The model is described as a universal mental shortcut for making sense of the world, with moderate confidence (0.7).
